Pedestrian Annual Traffic: Upto 1.25 million <\/p><p>Warranty: 15 months<\/p>","font_size":80,"font_type":"body-font"}},"button_CcRHKM":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["heading_xKT8RP","text_rRUwgB","button_CcRHKM"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UltiScrub_6x4_with_Swatches_1.png","autoplay_video":true,"image_ratio":"adapt","media_width":780,"vertical_text_align":"top","layout":"left","section_align":"left","overlap_text":true,"image_animation":"fade-up","background":"background-modal","frosted_glass":true,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44}},"large_media_with_text_box_wcgMWJ":{"type":"large-media-with-text-box","blocks":{"heading_QaYLWq":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Technical specifications","font_size":80}},"text_6XWaJr":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Product Name: UltiGrate<\/p><p>Application: Commercial heavy-traffic entrances<\/p><p>Material: Aluminium 6063T6 Anodized<\/p><p>Mat infills: Brush\/Rubber\/Carpet<\/p><p>Profile Height : 10 mm<\/p><p>Total Height (Brush): 14 mm<\/p><p>Total Height (Carpet): 12 mm<\/p><p>Matwell Depth: 10 mm<\/p><p>Pedestrian Annual Traffic: Upto 10 million <\/p><p>Trolley Crossings: Heavy (Max weight 600 Kgs)<\/p><p>Warranty: 5 years<\/p>","font_size":100}},"button_FcqrEC":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"button_label":"Configure your mat","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["heading_QaYLWq","text_6XWaJr","button_FcqrEC"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Entryway_Mat_3.jpg","autoplay_video":true,"full_width":true,"text_position":"top-left","container_width":425,"container_height":20,"inner_spacing":40,"vertical_position":39,"horizontal_position":100,"background":"background-modal","frosted_glass":false,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44}},"collapsible_content_QXqK9a":{"type":"collapsible-content","blocks":{"collapsible_row_WD6BM3":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_icon":"none","title":"How does UltiScrub have a combined scraping and drying action?","row_content":"<p>UltiScrub is a combination of high-quality stiff and soft polypropylene looped fiber tufts arranged at just the right distance to optimally scrape-off dirt by the stiff fibers while the soft fibers remove and retain moisture. <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_tdPPJk":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_icon":"none","title":"Is UltiScrub easy to clean?","row_content":"<p>Yes. UltiScrub is 100% washable and quick-drying. Tap or vacuum for light cleaning or hose-down with water for deep-cleaning<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_jGM4U8":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_icon":"none","title":"Why should a mat have borders?","row_content":"<p>For applications other than a recess or matwell, all commercial mats should have all-around borders. UltiScrub is double-compressed with vinyl borders that help significantly reduce trip and fall accidents, increase mat longevity and are aesthetically more appealing, giving an overall neat and finished appearance.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible_row_3JfeEa":{"type":"collapsible_row","settings":{"row_icon":"none","title":"Are there any regulatory guidelines on commercial entrance matting?","row_content":"<p>The Americans with Disabilities Act sets specific codes regulations for public and commercial buildings so that people with a wide range of disabilities can freely and easily access all areas of these buildings. The ADA even has very specific guidelines on entrance mats. The best mats for wheelchairs are our recessed metal mats and our surface-mount mats. Ensure easy access to all who enter your facility.<\/p><p><strong>The ADA has these set of guidelines:<\/strong><\/p><p>Carpet must be securely affixed to the ground, have a stiff or no backing at all, and be no more than 12.5mm thick. If the carpet is more than 12.5mm thick, there must be a beveled edge for wheels to effortlessly glide over.<br\/><\/p><p>Recessed entrance grates\/mats need to have less than 12.5mm between pieces to prevent wheels or any other movement facilitating equipment to get caught.<\/p><p>UltiScrub satisfies all ADA regulatory guidelines.<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["collapsible_row_WD6BM3","collapsible_row_tdPPJk","collapsible_row_jGM4U8","collapsible_row_3JfeEa"],"settings":{"show_information":false,"title":"FAQ","description":"<p>We've compiled a list of frequently asked questions to help you decide which matting configuration is the right choice for your premises. No matter what your needs may be, Ultimats has the right product for you.<\/p>","email_label":"","email":"","phone_label":"","phone":"","hours_label":"","hours":"","font_size":100,"background":"background-modal","padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44}},"rich_text_AkVmJE":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_gTBFic":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"","font_size":100,"font_type":"heading-font"}},"text_gqEX8q":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"","font_size":100,"font_type":"heading-font"}},"button_Yh9wT9":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_label":"customize your ultiscrub","button_link":"https:\/\/ultimats.com\/products\/ultiscrub-carpet-mat","button_style":"solid"}}},"block_order":["heading_gTBFic","text_gqEX8q","button_Yh9wT9"],"settings":{"text_align":"center","background":"main-background","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"contact_form_awRX6D":{"type":"contact-form","settings":{"heading":"need product support or a quote?","subtitle":"Our Customer Service Team Will Connect With You","show_email":false,"show_phone":false,"show_address":false,"custom_address":"","show_facebook":false,"handle_facebook":"Find us on Facebook","show_instagram":false,"handle_instagram":"Find us on Instagram","show_twitter":false,"handle_twitter":"Find us on Twitter","operation":"","response_time":"Thank you for contacting us. We will respond within 2 working days","font_size":100,"background":"main-background","padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44}}},"order":["main","ric